          "text": "Fitness business on autopilot: manage clients, get new ones, and scale effortlessly Fit Mentor automates the trainer's work and increases client results by 83% Try it for free Download on the App Store GET IT ON Google Play App description You train — we bring clients and automate their support! Fit Mentor is a convenient and intuitive app for trainers that: Automates reminders, payments, and communication Brings new clients Saves your time Helps control measurements, reports, nutrition, and client progress Motivates clients through gamification Key features Automation of routine tasks The app reminds clients about workouts, reports, and payments. You don't have to control everything manually! Progress tracking All client data in one place — reports, measurements, nutrition. See progress and adjust the plan in a couple of clicks. Gamification and motivation Clients earn points, unlock rewards and reach goals while having fun! Motivation rises, which means better results. Client acquisition Fit Mentor helps you find new clients. We bring the leads, and you bring them results! Chat with clients — everything in one place! No more switching between apps — keep conversations, manage the process, and keep clients engaged. Automation of routine tasks The app reminds clients about workouts, reports, and payments. You don't have to control everything manually! Benefits for trainers Your browser does not support video. How to handle 20 clients spending only 5 hours a week? With Fit Mentor — easily! Create workout and nutrition plans in a couple of clicks. Automate routine tasks and focus on growing your business. You train — we make you money! Become not just a trainer, but the owner of a scalable fitness business. Client testimonials Anna, Personal Trainer \"With Fit Mentor I doubled my income! Managing clients became easier and automation saved me tons of time.\" Ivan, Online Coach \"The app really helps! A workout program is created in a minute and clients stay motivated.\" Maria, Fitness Instructor \"With Fit Mentor I was able to grow my client base and all processes became automatic.\" Dmitry, Personal Trainer \"The app is convenient, all functions are in one place, I recommend it to every trainer!\" Elena, Fitness Trainer \"Automation of reminders and client communication saves me a lot of time.\" Sergey, Health Coach \"The intuitive interface and ease of use make work much more efficient.\" Anna, Personal Trainer \"With Fit Mentor I doubled my income! Managing clients became easier and automation saved me tons of time.\" Ivan, Online Coach \"The app really helps! A workout program is created in a minute and clients stay motivated.\" Maria, Fitness Instructor \"With Fit Mentor I was able to grow my client base and all processes became automatic.\" Dmitry, Personal Trainer \"The app is convenient, all functions are in one place, I recommend it to every trainer!\" Elena, Fitness Trainer \"Automation of reminders and client communication saves me a lot of time.\" Sergey, Health Coach \"The intuitive interface and ease of use make work much more efficient.\" Interface demo See how easy it is to create a month's workout, activity, and nutrition program in our app. Your browser does not support video. Try it yourself! Free registration right now. Download on the App Store GET IT ON Google Play Try all features free for 30 days Fit Mentor automates EVERYTHING: nutrition, measurements, reports, and client notifications. Download on the App Store GET IT ON Google Play",
